                <pb facs="0032" n="10" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v08/pg10"/>

                <head>2. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On April 27, the National Security Council, in Action No. 1542, directed the
                    Planning Board to undertake an immediate review of those sections of NSC 5409
                    pertaining to Afghanistan. This review was prompted by the recent Soviet aid
                    agreement with Afghanistan. At its 285th meeting on May 17, the NSC discussed
                    the Planning Board’s proposed changes in NSC 5409. For a memorandum of that
                    discussion, see <ref target="#d118">Document 118</ref>.</p>
            </div>
